(Welcome, Provisional Messenger) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Congratulations on your provisional promotion to Messenger \(Probationary, Unbonded\).) Tj
T*
(Your application to Earn, Belong, and Carry? has been pre-approved on your behalf. By) Tj
T*
(being handed this document, you have already begun. Thank you for your enthusiasm, which) Tj
T*
(has been noted and filed.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Section One | The Assignment) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(You will escort one \(1\) sealed [REDACTED]? cargo unit along the Approved Route to Hush,) Tj
T*
(and deliver it unopened to authorized personnel. The crate is friendly. The crate is) Tj
T*
(also sealed. These facts are not in tension. Do not open the crate.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Section Two | Compensation) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Upon verified delivery you will receive Goldspire Gratitude? \(one portion, non-) Tj
T*
(transferable, non-edible\), one \(1\) commemorative Employee of the Moment token, one \(1\)) Tj
T*
(bag of coin, and partial relief against your outstanding debt. Hazard pay is not) Tj
T*
(applicable, as the route is perfectly safe. Should the route prove unsafe, this will be) Tj
T*
(considered a clerical matter and addressed in a future quarter.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Section Three | Route and Conduct) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Remain on the Approved Route. The forest is corporate-managed, under-monitored, and) Tj
T*
(documented as hostile. Wildlife is dangerous, non-compliant, and resistant to route) Tj
T*
(culture. The trees have signed nothing and bear you documented ill will. Deviation from) Tj
T*
(the route voids Gratitude and all payment, and may be interpreted as non-compliance.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Section Four | Safety and Indemnity) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Your wellbeing is our highest priority. In the likely \(corrected from unlikely\) event of) Tj
T*
(injury, dismemberment, soul-encumbrance, spontaneous unionization, or death, Emeris) Tj
T*
(Crown Holdings, its clients, carriers, underwriters, and friendly subsidiaries are not) Tj
T*
(liable. Death is a schedulable inconvenience and should be reported within one \(1\)) Tj
T*
(business day to Soulspire Solutions?. No severance wages, separation consideration, or) Tj
T*
(post-mortem benefits are included.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Section Five | Employee Acknowledgements) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- I am grateful for this opportunity.) Tj
T*
(- I have no grievance with Emeris Crown Holdings, its clients, carriers, or friendly) Tj
T*
(  subsidiaries.) Tj
T*
(- I have personally witnessed no evidence of corporate wrongdoing.) Tj
T*
(- I understand that downsizing, restructuring, and synergy are positive.) Tj
T*
(- I will not open the crate.) Tj
T*
(- I will not deviate from the Approved Route.) Tj
